@startuml
actor User
participant Controller
participant OrderService
participant GoodsService
database Database

User -> Controller: 提交订单请求
activate Controller
Controller -> OrderService: 调用orderAdd方法
activate OrderService
OrderService -> GoodsService: 获取订单中餐品信息
activate GoodsService
GoodsService --> OrderService: 返回订单中餐品信息
deactivate GoodsService
loop 对每个订单进行处理
    OrderService -> OrderService: 设置订单编号、下单时间、用户ID等基本信息
    OrderService -> OrderService: 根据消费方式设置订单状态
    OrderService -> GoodsService: 获取订单中餐品的单价和库存信息
    activate GoodsService
    GoodsService --> OrderService: 返回订单中餐品的单价和库存信息
    deactivate GoodsService
    OrderService -> OrderService: 计算购买数量并更新餐品库存
end
OrderService -> Database: 批量保存订单数据
activate Database
Database --> OrderService: 保存订单数据成功
deactivate Database
OrderService --> Controller: 返回订单提交成功信息
deactivate OrderService
Controller --> User: 返回订单提交成功信息
deactivate Controller
@enduml
